{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18387","headline":"南至隔仗望含元殿香炉 · 崔立之","name":"南至隔仗望含元殿香炉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千官望长至，万国拜含元。\n隔仗炉光出，浮霜烟气翻。\n飘飘萦内殿，漠漠澹前轩。\n圣日开如捧，卿云近欲浑。\n轮囷洒宫阙，萧索散乾坤。\n愿倚天风便，披香奉至尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔立之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}